          }
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "text": "8. Never Ship As Root"
        },
        {
          "type": "bullets",
          "items": [
            "Default `USER` is **root** — an escape starts there",
            "Node images already ship a `node` user",
            "scratch/distroless have no `/etc/passwd`: use a number",
            "Set `USER` in the final stage, after the installs"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "text": "9. Exec Form Or Lose SIGTERM"
        },
        {
          "type": "code",
          "lang": "dockerfile",
          "lines": [
            "CMD node dist/main.js  # ✗ sh -c",
            "CMD [\"node\",\"dist/main.js\"]  # ✓",
            "HEALTHCHECK --interval=30s \\",
            "  CMD [\"node\",\"health.js\"]"
          ],
          "note": "shell form swallows SIGTERM"
